OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening and night with some light and
OL,7,Fpatchy rain or drizzle, but some drier
OL,8,Fspells of weather too. Fresh west or
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FMainly dry in the morning
OL,12,Fbefore some light and patchy rain
OL,13,Fextends south during the afternoon.
OL,14,FWinds easing down in the afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FChance
OL,17,Fof some rain at first on Tuesday,
OL,18,Fotherwise dry and much brighter.
OL,19,FBright with scattered showers on
OL,20,FWednesday. Dry on Thursday.
